Firstmate startup recovery with real tmux and Herdr. Both interruptions were induced by closing the actual disposable endpoint before the next real backend command.

== Endpoint closes while tmux is about to receive the launch text ==
tmux 3.7c
$ FM_BOOTSTRAP_NETWORK=only fm-bootstrap.sh (target)
Closed the disposable fm-sm1 window before delivering launch text.
can't find window: fm-sm1
